  "identity": "A pear-shaped green goblin overseer wearing a pit-pony's leather harness over patched brown workclothes. Huge ears and nose, crooked lower teeth, tiny miner's helmet with ONE brass oil lamp. A short coiled whip in EACH gloved hand, a quota tally board on his back with blank tally scratches only. Heavy scuffed boots and enormous fists. Frazzled overworked comic boss, no pony body.",
